{"url": "https://wiki.idlecorp.xyz/api.php?format=json&formatversion=2&action=parse&page=Help%3AIdleCorp+Profit&prop=text%7Clinks%7Cimages%7Ctemplates%7Ccategories&redirects=1", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-09T15:00:08.974166+00:00", "body": "{\"parse\":{\"title\":\"Help:IdleCorp Profit\",\"pageid\":231,\"redirects\":[],\"text\":\"<div class=\\\"mw-parser-output\\\"><p>If you do not know how to use or see the information of the <i>Profit</i>, <i>Ratio</i> or <i>any maths</i> about them, this page (or <a href=\\\"/index.php/Legend\\\" title=\\\"Legend\\\">here</a>) may can help you more about that.<br />\\n<i>Note: This just for the pages and information in <b>this wiki (IdleCorp Wiki)</b></i>\\n</p>\\n<div id=\\\"toc\\\" class=\\\"toc\\\"><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" role=\\\"button\\\" id=\\\"toctogglecheckbox\\\" class=\\\"toctogglecheckbox\\\" style=\\\"display:none\\\" /><div class=\\\"toctitle\\\" lang=\\\"en\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><h2>Contents</h2><span class=\\\"toctogglespan\\\"><label class=\\\"toctogglelabel\\\" for=\\\"toctogglecheckbox\\\"></label></span></div>\\n<ul>\\n<li class=\\\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\\\"><a href=\\\"#Cost\\\"><span class=\\\"tocnumber\\\">1</span> <span class=\\\"toctext\\\">Cost</span></a>\\n<ul>\\n<li class=\\\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\\\"><a href=\\\"#Cost_2\\\"><span class=\\\"tocnumber\\\">1.1</span> <span class=\\\"toctext\\\">Cost</span></a></li>\\n<li class=\\\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\\\"><a href=\\\"#Total_Cost\\\"><span class=\\\"tocnumber\\\">1.2</span> <span class=\\\"toctext\\\">Total Cost</span></a></li>\\n</ul>\\n</li>\\n<li class=\\\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\\\"><a href=\\\"#Production\\\"><span class=\\\"tocnumber\\\">2</span> <span class=\\\"toctext\\\">Production</span></a>\\n<ul>\\n<li class=\\\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\\\"><a href=\\\"#Consumes_.28Inputs.29\\\"><span class=\\\"tocnumber\\\">2.1</span> <span class=\\\"toctext\\\">Consumes (Inputs)</span></a></li>\\n<li class=\\\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\\\"><a href=\\\"#Produces_.28Outputs.29\\\"><span class=\\\"tocnumber\\\">2.2</span> <span class=\\\"toctext\\\">Produces (Outputs)</span></a></li>\\n<li class=\\\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\\\"><a href=\\\"#Production_interval\\\"><span class=\\\"tocnumber\\\">2.3</span> <span class=\\\"toctext\\\">Production interval</span></a></li>\\n<li class=\\\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\\\"><a href=\\\"#Production.2FMin\\\"><span class=\\\"tocnumber\\\">2.4</span> <span class=\\\"toctext\\\">Production/Min</span></a></li>\\n</ul>\\n</li>\\n<li class=\\\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\\\"><a href=\\\"#Profit\\\"><span class=\\\"tocnumber\\\">3</span> <span class=\\\"toctext\\\">Profit</span></a>\\n<ul>\\n<li class=\\\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\\\"><a href=\\\"#Profit_per\\\"><span class=\\\"tocnumber\\\">3.1</span> <span class=\\\"toctext\\\">Profit per</span></a></li>\\n<li class=\\\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\\\"><a href=\\\"#Return_On_Investment\\\"><span class=\\\"tocnumber\\\">3.2</span> <span class=\\\"toctext\\\">Return On Investment</span></a></li>\\n</ul>\\n</li>\\n<li class=\\\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\\\"><a href=\\\"#Ratio\\\"><span class=\\\"tocnumber\\\">4</span> <span class=\\\"toctext\\\">Ratio</span></a>\\n<ul>\\n<li class=\\\"toclevel-2 tocsection-13\\\"><a href=\\\"#Minimum\\\"><span class=\\\"tocnumber\\\">4.1</span> <span class=\\\"toctext\\\">Minimum</span></a></li>\\n<li class=\\\"toclevel-2 tocsection-14\\\"><a href=\\\"#Meta_Ratio\\\"><span class=\\\"tocnumber\\\">4.2</span> <span class=\\\"toctext\\\">Meta Ratio</span></a></li>\\n</ul>\\n</li>\\n<li class=\\\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\\\"><a href=\\\"#Disclaimer\\\"><span class=\\\"tocnumber\\\">5</span> <span class=\\\"toctext\\\">Disclaimer</span></a></li>\\n</ul>\\n</div>\\n\\n<h2><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Cost\\\">Cost</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Help:IdleCorp_Profit&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Cost\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h2>\\n<h3><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Cost_2\\\">Cost</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Help:IdleCorp_Profit&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Cost\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h3>\\n<p>The cost may contain <a href=\\\"/index.php/Asset\\\" class=\\\"mw-redirect\\\" title=\\\"Asset\\\">assets</a> other than <a href=\\\"/index.php/Capital\\\" title=\\\"Capital\\\">capital</a>, for the construction cost, you cannot receive the assets back when you demolish the facilities.\\n</p>\\n<h3><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Total_Cost\\\">Total Cost</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Help:IdleCorp_Profit&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Total Cost\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h3>\\n<p>The total cost calculates the total value of the cost and the capital.\\n</p>\\n<h2><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Production\\\">Production</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Help:IdleCorp_Profit&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Production\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h2>\\n<h3><span id=\\\"Consumes_(Inputs)\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Consumes_.28Inputs.29\\\">Consumes (Inputs)</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Help:IdleCorp_Profit&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Consumes (Inputs)\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h3>\\n<p>Literally, as the <i>inputs</i> of facility, they are the <i>consumption</i> of the facilities.<br />\\nIt has the speed for the information originally, but this have not.\\n</p>\\n<h3><span id=\\\"Produces_(Outputs)\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Produces_.28Outputs.29\\\">Produces (Outputs)</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Help:IdleCorp_Profit&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Produces (Outputs)\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h3>\\n<p>Literally, as the <i>outputs</i> of facility, they are the <i>production</i> of the facilities.<br />\\nIt has the speed for the information originally, but this have not.\\n</p>\\n<h3><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Production_interval\\\">Production interval</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Help:IdleCorp_Profit&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Production interval\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h3>\\n<p>They are the times as <i>second</i> for the unit.\\n</p>\\n<h3><span id=\\\"Production/Min\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Production.2FMin\\\">Production/Min</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Help:IdleCorp_Profit&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Production/Min\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h3>\\n<p>This is the speed for the <i>produces</i> (or the outputs/production), which use per minute for the unit. You can know you can get how many of them per minute, if you want to know \\\"in a hour\\\", just times 60.\\n</p>\\n<h2><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Profit\\\">Profit</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Help:IdleCorp_Profit&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Profit\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h2>\\n<h3><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Profit_per\\\">Profit per</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Help:IdleCorp_Profit&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Profit per\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h3>\\n<p><b>/Min</b> and <b>/Hour</b> are the capital you can get from buying the materials for the inputs and the production to know how much you can get from each of the facility\\n</p>\\n<h3><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Return_On_Investment\\\">Return On Investment</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Help:IdleCorp_Profit&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Return On Investment\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h3>\\n<p>This is when you are using buying from the NPC market for the support instead of set the facilities to the inputs of the facility, you can get the capital for the facility and you will know is this worth for this.\\n</p>\\n<h2><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Ratio\\\">Ratio</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Help:IdleCorp_Profit&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Ratio\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h2>\\n<p>The order is always follow to the IdleCorp Profit.\\n</p>\\n<h3><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Minimum\\\">Minimum</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Help:IdleCorp_Profit&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Minimum\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h3>\\n<p>This is the minimum numbers of the facility requirements you will needed to build when you want 100% passive\\n</p>\\n<h3><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Meta_Ratio\\\">Meta Ratio</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Help:IdleCorp_Profit&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Meta Ratio\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h3>\\n<p>The left side are the consumption facilities, and the right side are the facility.<br />\\nThey follow to the outputs for the consumption facilities, and the inputs for the facility\\n</p>\\n<h2><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Disclaimer\\\">Disclaimer</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Help:IdleCorp_Profit&amp;action=edit&amp;section=15\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Disclaimer\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h2>\\n<p>The data in the wiki is only for calculation and reference only, they are the base values. The real value may vary.\\n</p>\\n<!-- \\nNewPP limit report\\nCached time: 20261009010733\\nCache expiry: 86400\\nDynamic content: false\\nComplications: []\\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\\nPreprocessor visited node count: 48/1000000\\nPreprocessor generated node count: 0/1000000\\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\\nHighest expansion depth: 2/40\\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\\n-->\\n<!--\\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\\n-->\\n\\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key icwiki:pcache:idhash:231-0!canonical and timestamp 20261009010733 and revision id 1656\\n -->\\n</div>\",\"categories\":[],\"links\":[{\"ns\":0,\"title\":\"Asset\",\"exists\":true},{\"ns\":0,\"title\":\"Capital\",\"exists\":true},{\"ns\":0,\"title\":\"Legend\",\"exists\":true}],\"templates\":[],\"images\":[]}}"}